stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Registration : Device not registered

    state Registration {
        [*] --> UDPCtx
        UDPCtx : UDP context<br/>(activate PDP + open socket)
        IP : Get IPv6<br/>(AT+CGPADDR)
        Send : Send REGISTER_REQUEST<br/>(IMEI + IPv6 · QISENDEX)
        Wait : Wait for REGISTER_RESPONSE<br/>(poll QIRD · re-poll / resend if no data)
        Proc : Process response<br/>(sync RTC · store<br/>credentials and next_wake)
        Ack : Send ACK<br/>and drain HES confirmation

        UDPCtx --> IP : socket open
        IP --> Send : IPv6 obtained
        Send --> Wait : SEND OK
        Wait --> Proc : REGISTER_RESPONSE
        Proc --> Ack : flag = OK
    }

    Ack --> Registered : ACK sent
    Registration --> Backoff : error / timeout

    Backoff : Exponential backoff
    Backoff --> Registration : retry (increasing wait)
    Backoff --> ResetMCU : N consecutive failures

    Registered : Registered<br/>(credentials in EEPROM)
    Registered --> [*]
    ResetMCU : MCU reset
    ResetMCU --> [*]
